<title>USA: MBIA qualifies two more issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies two more issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance two more issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Mishawaka-Penn Library, Ind., $6.3 million of bonds.</p>
<p>--Canon McMillen SD, Pa., $5 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
